    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dawnhelm Defense is a strategic tower defense game set in a medieval-fantasy world where players must defend the mighty fortress of Dawnhelm from relentless waves of enemy invaders. As the last line of defense, you will build and upgrade powerful towers and deploy magical abilities to stop hordes of monstrous creatures, rogue warbands, and dark sorcerers seeking to bring ruin to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of unique towers, each with their own strengths, you\u2019ll need to carefully plan your defenses to counter different enemy types. Dynamic conditions and special events add an extra layer of challenge, and unlocked skills can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you protect the fortress and lead the kingdom to victory, or will Dawnhelm fall to the enemy? The fate of the realm is in your hands!</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Dawnhelm Defense is a strategic tower defense game set in a medieval-fantasy world where players must defend the mighty fortress of Dawnhelm from relentless waves of enemy invaders. As the last line of defense, you will build and upgrade powerful towers and deploy magical abilities to stop hordes of monstrous creatures, rogue warbands, and dark sorcerers seeking to bring ruin to the kingdom.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With a variety of unique towers, each with their own strengths, you\u2019ll need to carefully plan your defenses to counter different enemy types. Dynamic conditions and special events add an extra layer of challenge, and unlocked skills can turn the tide of battle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Can you protect the fortress and lead the kingdom to victory, or will Dawnhelm fall to the enemy? The fate of the realm is in your hands!</p>",
